WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:03.950
The Maiami Championship has finally started.

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:08.990
You Show School's first winner was Futoshi.

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.040
His duel gave me shivers!

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.430
It wasn't that special.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.540
Ayu was next, but...

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.760
I lost.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:22.500
Ayu's opponent Layra was strange.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:25.400
He was timid in the beginning,

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:29.300
but he surprised me in 
the end by using Fusion.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.510
I'm a bit concerned about him.

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.980
Now it's finally Yuzu's turn!

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:37.380
My opponent of destiny is Masumi Koutsu,

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:40.820
who defeated me in the You 
Show School vs LDS match.

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:44.190
I must not lose this duel!

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:45.720
Do your best, Yuzu!

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:50.500
Yuzu!  Use your fighting spirit 
to get your hot-blooded revenge!

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:57.240
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:00:57.330 --> 00:01:02.090
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:05.110
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.420
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:28.200
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:31.610
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:40.350
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:44.920
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:47.120
Impulse  Got it got it

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:52.330
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:03.070
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:10.010
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:13.950
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:17.350
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:02:17.350 --> 00:02:27.630
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:30.970
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:41.010
Fusing Maestra!

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:45.040
Maiami Championship!

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:48.840
This duelist festival is the 
gateway to becoming a pro duelist.

00:02:49.030 --> 00:02:52.500
Those with passion have gathered here!

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:54.920
Let's blast it!

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:59.500
Yuzu, do your best!

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:02.180
I'm expecting a duel that 
will give me shivers!

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:03.760
Stay calm!

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:15.100
Masumi and Syun Kurosaki were rivals.

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:16.860
However...

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:19.360
What are you talking about?

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:22.040
He's been our teammate from the start.

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:25.260
What's going on?

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.790
Your eyes are clouded.

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:34.120
I have to focus!

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:38.660
I lost last time because I was 
worried that Yuya was Ute!

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.730
I won't let that happen again!

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:45.200
I'll show you that I'm different 
than before in this duel!

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:48.520
Fine.  It's a tournament after all.

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:51.240
If you don't try hard, there's 
no sense of accomplishment.

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:54.200
Everyone, thanks for waiting!

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:59.260
You Show School's entertainment 
duelist Yuzu Hiiragi!

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:02.480
Masumi Koutsu of Leo Duel School,

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:06.190
the prestigious school with the 
most entrants in this tournament!

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:08.460
Their match is about to begin!

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:12.120
I'm fired up!

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:13.520
Get your revenge!

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.000
Yuzu!

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:26.920
First, select the Action Field!

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:31.460
Which random Field Spell Card 
will the machine choose?

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:35.520
Action Field on!

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:39.290
The Field Spell Infinite Bridges activates!

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:02.610
If you take one false 
step, you'll fall to hell!

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:05.610
In this tension-filled field,

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:12.220
which of these two Junior Youth 
flower buds will fully bloom?

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:15.500
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:19.460
Along with their monsters, they'll kick 
the ground and fly through the sky...

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.370
...to move around the field!

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:24.240
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:25.870
Action!

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:27.560
Duel!

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:31.360
I'll go first!

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:35.110
I activate the spell card Gem-Knight Fusion!

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:39.590
With this card, I can Fusion Summon 
using Gem-Knights in my hand!

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:44.560
You're fusing cards in your hand on 
your first turn, just like last time.

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:51.560
I fuse three Gem-Knights in my 
hand: Sapphire, Garnet and Crystal!

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:57.440
Solid blue will!  Red truth!  Glass eye!

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:01.520
Create a whirlpool of light and 
shine bright as you become one!

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:04.280
Fusion Summon!

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:08.250
Appear, the supreme brilliance 
that illuminates everything!

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:11.150
Gem-Knight Master Diamond!

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:17.080
You already brought out your ace.

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:24.520
Master Diamond gains 100 attack points 
for every Gem monster in the graveyard.

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:28.160
She has three Gem-Knights in her graveyard.

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:30.740
Therefore, it gains 300 attack points.

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:40.380
I set one card and end my turn.

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:43.260
It's your turn.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:46.890
Show me that you've changed!

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:48.580
My turn!

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:52.360
I draw!

00:06:56.260 --> 00:07:00.770
I activate the spell card 
Polymerization from my hand!

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:02.500
Polymerization?

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:05.970
Whoa!  Hiiragi is also fusing!

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:10.410
I fuse Aria the Melodious 
Diva and Sonata from my hand!

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.800
Let your singing voices 
ring and the melody flow!

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:16.800
Follow the baton and stack your power!

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:19.690
Fusion Summon!

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:21.920
Take the stage!

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:25.260
Schuberta the Melodious Maestra!

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:32.140
It's Yuzu's fusion!

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:33.500
It gives me shivers!

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:37.700
Nice, Yuzu!  You're shining today!

00:07:37.980 --> 00:07:42.320
Once per turn, Schuberta can banish 
all cards from the graveyard

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:46.300
that were used to summon a Fusion Monster!

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:52.840
Since you Fusion Summoned Master Diamond, 
I banish Sapphire, Garnet, Crystal

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:57.220
and the spell card Gem-Knight 
Fusion from your graveyard!

00:07:57.500 --> 00:07:59.140
Chorus Break!

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:03.230
Good!  Since three Gem-Knights were banished,

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:06.100
Master Diamond loses 300 attack points!

00:08:06.940 --> 00:08:13.510
And during this turn, it gains 200 
attack points for every banished card!

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:18.180
She lowered her opponent's attack points 
while gaining 800 attack points!

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.520
That's not all.

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:23.400
She used Gem-Knight Fusion to Fusion Summon.

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:26.360
That card can be returned to 
her hand from her graveyard

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:29.080
if she banishes one Gem-Knight 
from her graveyard.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:32.760
Yuzu's tactic stopped that too.

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:37.230
But you know this, don't you.

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:38.700
Let's battle!

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:42.560
Schuberta attacks Master Diamond!

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:45.060
Wave of the Great!

00:08:53.620 --> 00:08:56.600
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:08:56.720 --> 00:09:00.800
And Schuberta's attack points 
now return to normal.

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:05.840
Hey, You Show School is dueling well!

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:07.760
Masumi has zero cards in her hand.

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:10.840
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:15.360
I'm surprised that you're using fusion.

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:19.940
But it's nowhere near my level.

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:21.600
Stop acting tough!

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:23.920
You only have one card in your hand.

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:25.910
That's not enough cards to fuse.

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:27.600
Are you sure about that?

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:32.460
I activate the Continuous Spell 
Brilliant Fusion from my hand!

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:39.530
This card lets me use monsters in my 
deck to Fusion Summon a Gem-Knight!

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:41.080
Monsters in your deck?

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:43.260
From my deck...

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:49.500
I select and fuse Gem-Knight 
Alexandrite, Emerald and Obsidian!

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:52.480
She can select and fuse 
three monsters in her deck

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.600
without having to summon them first?

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:57.480
That girl is better than I thought.

00:09:58.600 --> 00:10:00.580
The magical stone that's both day and night!

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:03.440
The glimmering green that brings luck!

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:05.240
The sharp blackness!

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:09.180
Create a whirlpool of light and 
shine bright as you become one!

00:10:09.940 --> 00:10:13.680
Fusion Summon!  This is my true ace!

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:19.340
The shining lady!  Gem-Knight 
Lady Brilliant Diamond!

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:24.640
Good!  Show her LDS's Fusion!

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:28.560
When Brilliant Fusion 
Special Summons a monster,

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:31.610
it has 0 attack and defense points.

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:32.580
What?

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:36.200
But by sending one spell 
card to the graveyard,

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:40.550
it gets its original attack 
points back until my next turn!

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:45.390
What's going on?

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:47.080
An Action Card!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:50.360
She's planning to use an Action Card

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:53.300
to return Brilliant Diamond's 
attack points back to 3400!

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:55.220
I won't let you!

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:58.220
I activate the trap Musical Mayhem!

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:03.740
You take 800 points of damage for 
every Melodious monster on my field!

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:15.660
Incredible!  No wonder she's an LDS elite!

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:18.360
She got an Action Card 
with an incredible move!

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:22.490
I send an Action Spell to the graveyard

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:28.080
so that Brilliant Diamond regains its 
attack points until my next turn!

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:33.510
Let's battle!  Brilliant 
Diamond attacks Schuberta!

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:44.650
Yuzu!

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:48.590
That was close!

00:11:48.590 --> 00:11:52.860
Hiiragi grabbed the rail to avoid falling!

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:57.800
I was worried for a moment, but 
she's back to her usual self.

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:05.560
Do you now understand the 
difference between our skills?

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:07.770
I end my turn.

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:09.520
My turn!

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:14.640
If she gets an Action Card again, 
I'll be at a bigger disadvantage.

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:16.340
I have to do something.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:17.860
I draw!

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:23.020
I set one monster in defense position.

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:26.790
It seems there's nothing left you can do.

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:33.140
If Masumi is the duelist that I 
think she is, then she will...

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:37.200
I set one card and end my turn!

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:38.100
What?

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:39.840
She's done?

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:41.670
Don't panic.

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:44.040
She should be able to survive this

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:49.150
because I taught her how to 
battle against Fusion users.

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:51.120
My turn!

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:57.720
Due to Brilliant Fusion's effect, Brilliant 
Diamond's attack points now become 0.

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:01.930
I won't let you get an Action Card!

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:05.160
I'll stop you!  I summon Crystal Rose!

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:13.240
Crystal Rose can replace a monster 
that's needed to Fusion Summon!

00:13:13.240 --> 00:13:17.010
I treat Crystal Rose as 
Gem-Knight Tourmaline!

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:19.720
I activate Brilliant Diamond's effect!

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:22.700
I can fuse by sending 
one monster on the field

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:26.490
that's needed to Fusion 
Summon to the graveyard!

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:29.000
Fusion Summon with one monster?

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:31.960
This is Brilliant Diamond's power!

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:37.300
I send Crystal Rose that's treated as 
Tourmaline to Fusion Summon Gem-Knight Zirconia!

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:40.130
Grind Fusion!

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:43.270
Appear, the blinding radiance!

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:44.640
Gem-Knight Zirconia!

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:54.000
An Action Card!

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:55.250
She took it!

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:59.360
I send an Action Spell to the graveyard

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:02.320
to return Brilliant Diamond's 
attack points to normal!

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:10.830
Brilliant Diamond's attack points are 
back to normal again until her next turn.

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:12.480
Let's battle!

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:15.860
First, Zirconia attacks your set monster!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:31.280
Now you don't have any 
monsters to protect you.

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:32.580
This is the end!

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:36.460
Brilliant Diamond attacks you directly!

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.900
I activate the trap Fusion Cycle!

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:55.290
I can Special Summon one monster 
you used to Fusion Summon this turn

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:58.380
from your graveyard to my 
field in attack position!

00:14:58.600 --> 00:14:59.900
From my graveyard?

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:04.400
I summon Crystal Rose!

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:07.850
When this effect Special Summons a monster,

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:10.380
it can't be destroyed in battle this turn!

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:12.830
But you'll still take damage!

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:22.270
I end my turn.

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:28.540
If I didn't Fusion Summon this turn, you 
wouldn't have been able to use Fusion Cycle.

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:31.510
You should feel lucky.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:35.480
It wasn't luck.

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:42.100
Masumi, you have pride as a Fusion user.

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:46.930
So I knew that you would try to 
finish me with a Fusion Monster.

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:51.840
That's what gave me life and hope.

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:57.440
Don't get optimistic just 
because you barely survived.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:03.640
Show me if you can do anything more 
than fight back in vain next turn!

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:06.610
Of course!  My turn!

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:13.260
With that card, you're 
working hard to change.

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:20.240
Wanting to change and become stronger 
for your friends isn't wrong.

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:24.860
I decided to become stronger for my friends.

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:26.870
I draw!

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:34.400
I'll now show you my radiance!

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:37.040
I summon Soprano the Melodious Songstress!

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:47.130
If I use my Soprano to Fusion Summon,

00:16:47.130 --> 00:16:50.190
I can Fusion Summon without 
using a Fusion Spell!

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:54.560
Is she going to use my Crystal Rose?

00:16:54.780 --> 00:17:00.480
Crystal Rose can be treated as another 
monster that's required to Fusion Summon.

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:06.040
I treat Crystal Rose as Mozarta 
the Melodious Maestra!

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:08.140
She's beautiful.

00:17:08.140 --> 00:17:11.010
It's like a fairy was 
born from a crystal rose!

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:17.320
Due to Soprano the Melodious Songstress's 
effect, Soprano fuses with Crystal Rose!

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:21.020
The angel's song!  The supreme genius!

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:24.620
Follow the baton and stack your power!

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.460
Fusion Summon!

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:32.000
Take the stage with the song of victory!

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:35.370
Bloom Diva the Melodious Choir!

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:44.840
That's Yuzu's new ace.

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:47.340
She didn't use a Fusion Spell.

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:50.280
She used Masumi's card to fuse!

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:54.490
Bloom Diva attacks Gem-Knight Zirconia!

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:57.090
What?  The opponent's monster is stronger!

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:07.800
Bloom Diva can't be destroyed in battle 
against a monster that was Special Summoned.

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:13.160
You take the battle damage, 
and your monster is destroyed!

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:15.500
Reflect Shout!

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:22.520
She did it!

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:23.800
That's big damage!

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:25.520
I'm getting shivers!

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:28.280
How dare you...

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:32.120
But that will lead to your downfall.

00:18:32.660 --> 00:18:35.840
I activate the trap Brilliant Spark!

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:39.850
When a Gem-Knight on my field is destroyed,

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:42.920
you take damage equal to its attack points!

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:47.620
The destroyed Zirconia 
has 2900 attack points!

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:49.540
If Yuzu takes this, she'll lose!

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:53.080
I activate the trap Melodious Illusion!

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:57.550
It negates your trap that activated 
during my turn's battle,

00:18:57.550 --> 00:19:01.500
and one Melodious monster can attack again!

00:19:02.460 --> 00:19:03.420
Hooray!

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:05.140
She's making a comeback!

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:06.730
Hey, look!

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:09.460
Brilliant Spark's other effect!

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:13.360
By sending one Spell Card to the graveyard,

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:16.600
this card negates a trap-negating effect!

00:19:16.740 --> 00:19:17.640
This is bad!

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:22.810
If she gets that Action Card, since 
Melodious Illusion's effect hasn't ended yet...

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:27.250
...the damage-negating effect will 
be negated, and Yuzu will lose!

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:30.580
It's mine!

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:39.800
Whoa!  Hiiragi got the Action 
Card with a diving catch!

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:43.360
When it comes to action, 
You Show School won't lose!

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:46.830
No way!  She jumped down from that height?

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:51.070
Becoming one with my monsters 
is how You Show School duels.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:56.720
Due to Melodious Illusion's effect, 
Bloom Diva can attack again!

00:19:57.440 --> 00:20:02.250
This is the end!  Bloom Diva 
attacks Brilliant Diamond!

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:05.180
Reflect Shout!

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:11.090
Masumi!

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:20.600
You saved me?

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:34.900
The fight for Action Cards determined 
the outcome of this duel!

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:38.220
The winner is You Show School's Hiiragi!

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:39.650
Yuzu won-

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:43.880
Well done, Yuzu!  That's 
why you're my daughter!

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:46.720
My blood is boiling!

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:49.960
You did it, Yuzu.

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:52.840
Now do you understand how incredible I am?

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:57.080
What's with that guy!

00:20:57.080 --> 00:21:00.860
Did he leave without watching 
the most important part?

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:07.980
Yuzu, when you used your opponent's 
monster to fuse, I got shivers!

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:12.720
Of course she was able do 
it.  I taught her after all.

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:14.690
Yuzu Hiiragi!

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:18.660
Masumi...

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:24.260
Since you defeated me, 
you better keep winning.

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:34.700
I couldn't stand it if I lost to someone 
who couldn't win the tournament!

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:36.580
So take this.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:43.880
This is Crystal Rose.  Why?

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:52.700
You need that card to show the brilliance 
you displayed in today's duel.

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:53.860
See you.

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:57.400
I won't forgive you if you lose!

00:22:00.680 --> 00:22:03.000
Masumi!  Thank you!

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:07.440
I'm going to shine even more brilliantly!

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:18.980
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:19.200 --> 00:22:28.460
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.350 --> 00:22:40.470
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.720 --> 00:22:45.710
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.990 --> 00:22:51.150
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.400 --> 00:22:56.380
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.600 --> 00:23:02.010
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:02.010 --> 00:23:06.430
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.720 --> 00:23:12.400
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.400 --> 00:23:17.810
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.810 --> 00:23:23.110
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:32.450
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.480 --> 00:23:40.700
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:46.200 --> 00:23:50.800
My first opponent is my former 
senior teammate Gen Ankokuji.

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:58.040
He insulted Yuya, abandoned Gongenzaka 
Dojo's teachings and left.

00:23:58.280 --> 00:24:02.080
The time has come!  I 
have an immovable heart!

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:06.240
I cannot afford to lose this match!

00:24:06.460 --> 00:24:11.030
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Immovable Heart Tested

00:24:11.160 --> 00:24:13.480
The fun is only getting started!
